questions.stem:
A parking meter ticks down from any starting value with this method:
public static void tick(int n) { if (n == 1) return; System.out.print(n); tick(n - 1); }
Calling tick(0) overflows the stack. What is the fault?

A reading club counts vowels recursively, with the empty base already written:
public static int countVowels(String s) {
  if (s.isEmpty()) return 0;
  _____;
}
Which line belongs in the blank?

A lab's growth model always returns 0 because of this method:
public static int pow(int b, int e) { if (e == 0) return 0; return b * pow(b, e - 1); }
What is the fault?

A swim coach prints every lap number down to 0 with this method:
public static void tick(int n) { if (n < 0) return; System.out.print(n); _____; }
Which line belongs in the blank?

A cashier sums shelf prices from position i onward with this helper:
static int sumRest(int[] a, int i) { if (i == a.length) return 0; return _____; }
Which expression belongs in the blank?

A word club tests palindromes recursively, with short words already handled:
public static boolean isPal(String s) {
  if (s.length() <= 1) return true;
  _____;
}
Which line belongs in the blank?

A file crawler overflows the stack with this helper:
static void list(String dir) { for (String sub : subdirs(dir)) list(dir); }
What is the fault?

A tile layer multiplies with repeated addition:
static int mult(int a, int b) { if (b == 0) return 0; return _____; }
Which expression belongs in the blank?

A botanist evaluates flower groupings with this method:
public static int fib(int n) { if (n <= 1) return n; return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2); }
What integer does fib(3) return?

To measure explosive growth, an analyst tallies all fib invocations, initial call included, for this method:
public static int fib(int n) { if (n <= 1) return n; return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2); }
How many calls run in total when evaluating fib(4)?

A lighting tech programs a rebound cue with this method:
public static void yo(int n) { if (n == 0) return; yo(n - 1); System.out.print(n); }
Calling yo(3) runs the cue. What is printed?

A tile layer multiplies with this method:
static int mult(int a, int b) { if (b == 0) return 0; return a + mult(a, b - 1); }
What integer does mult(4, 3) return?

Ahead of the spring census, volunteers total rabbit ears with this method:
public static int ears(int bunnies) { if (bunnies == 0) return 0; return 2 + ears(bunnies - 1); }
What integer does ears(5) return?
